                  "description": {
                    "value": "A swirling torrent of water manifests along a straight line, battering those that are its path and possibly pushing them away from you. The torrent deals 8d6 bludgeoning damage. Each creature in the area must attempt a basic Fortitude save. Creatures that fail the save are also knocked back 5 feet (10 feet on a critical failure)."
